IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `isl-nouns`
IMPORT `isl-p5-claims-payment`
IMPORT `isl-p5-duties`
IMPORT `isl-seat`

-- Cases for the seat (layer 2): one or more cases for every question in isl-seat.l4, asked the way the person asks it, with plain inputs.
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the Law, beside each assertion, and not copied from a run.  The seat restates no rule, so a case here
-- is also a check that the seat passed the person's answers to the right rule in the right order.
-- Round figures: a basic amount of 10,000 and an average wage of 10,000, so that every percentage in the Law can be worked out by hand.
-- Reading a result: JUST TRUE is "yes", JUST FALSE is "no, the text says so in its own words", NOTHING is "the Law does not answer that" (NOTES.md, "Reading a result: FALSE and NOTHING").

§ `Am I entitled? s 2`
-- s 2(a)(1): no capacity to work, no proviso attaches
#ASSERT `Am I entitled because I cannot work or cannot be placed in any work` TRUE FALSE `none of these` `someone else` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not placeable, found by the probation officer who supervises the person, for a period within the Minister's limit
#ASSERT `Am I entitled because I cannot work or cannot be placed in any work` FALSE TRUE `under the supervision of a probation officer under the Arrests Law` `a probation officer` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not placeable, found by the diagnosis centre or the institution that treats the person
#ASSERT `Am I entitled because I cannot work or cannot be placed in any work` FALSE TRUE `treated in an institution or in drug withdrawal under a court probation order` `a drug-addiction diagnosis centre approved by the Minister, or the institution in which the person is treated` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the wrong body made the finding
#ASSERT `Am I entitled because I cannot work or cannot be placed in any work` FALSE TRUE `under the supervision of a probation officer under the Arrests Law` `someone else` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the finding is for longer than the Minister allows
#ASSERT `Am I entitled because I cannot work or cannot be placed in any work` FALSE TRUE `staying at an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry` `an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither no capacity nor not placeable
#ASSERT `Am I entitled because I cannot work or cannot be placed in any work` FALSE FALSE `none of these` `someone else` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
